rectangle "**2014** — OWIN Middleware (.NET)\nApp.Use() — łańcuch middleware" as Y2014 #E3F2FD
rectangle "**2016** — ASP.NET Core Middleware Pipeline\nApp.UseRouting().UseAuthentication().UseAuthorization()" as Y2016 #EDE7F6
